---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+17725550199';
const phoneDisplay = '(772) 555-0199';
---
<Layout title="Water Damage & Mold in Fort Pierce, FL | Fort Pierce Mold Specialists" description="Water damage and mold remediation in Fort Pierce. Fast response after leaks, floods, and storms to prevent mold growth.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Water Damage & Mold Services</h1>
      <p>Water damage and mold remediation in Fort Pierce. Fast response after leaks, floods, and storms to prevent mold growth.</p>
      <a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary" style="margin-top:1.25rem">Call </a>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:800px">
<h2>When Water Meets Humidity</h2>
<p>In Fort Pierce, water from roof leaks, plumbing failures, storms, or flooding can lead to mold within 24–48 hours. Addressing moisture and mold together is essential.</p>
<ul>
<li>Identify and stop the water source</li>
<li>Drying and dehumidification</li>
<li>Assessment for mold growth</li>
<li>Remediation of any resulting mold</li>
</ul>
<p>Call early — the sooner moisture is controlled, the less extensive (and costly) mold remediation becomes.</p>
      <p style="margin-top:2rem"><a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Call Now — </a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
